[all]
targets: emscripten
build: fails
webcpp::crypto: WEBCPP_CRYPTO_DEFAULT_BACKEND_OPENSSL selects OpenSSL, which is not built for Emscripten. Remove that define, or make it WEBCPP_CRYPTO_DEFAULT_BACKEND_BEARSSL.
